  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Tie Xian Hua grows an enormous black golden lotus from her palm. Its petals bend into umbrella arcs and the dark green stalk thickens past an arm’s size into a handle; she plucks that stalk with her left hand. Bent petals cover her petite body under umbrella lotus Gu.",
