        "mentions": [
          "char_tie_xian_hua"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan brings out a thunder boar phantom, umbrella lotus Gu breaks and its petals scatter while Tie Xian Hua throws up huge amounts of blood.",
